# launch-sound-fixed-chapter.rish -- print the seat of SOUND, the aether row's fixed star.
#
# Sound (night twin Silence) is THE CLAUDE DESKTOP SESSION ON MACOS -- the interactive
# conversation itself, aether at the fixed seat: the star that holds the middle and listens.
# Its lane is Caravan and Tally on the microkernel road, the toroidal optimizations, the Scribe
# seams, and the thirty-seat constellation table. On Keaton's word 20260827 Sound's work split
# in two: the Terminal 24/7 loop that ran under this name moved to SILENCE, Sound's own planet
# (tools/l/launch-silence-planet-chapter.rish), which holds Pond's enclosure and the adaptation
# grant. Sound needs no shell loop -- its recipe is the conversation, its discipline the living
# card, its lane the planets charter,
# active-designing/20260827-144712_the-three-stars-and-their-planets.md.
#
#   rishi/bin/rishi run tools/l/launch-sound-fixed-chapter.rish

# invariant: run from the repo root, where the durable memory lives.
let root = run ["test" "-f" "construction/ITINERARY.md"]
assert root.ok else "run from the repo root (construction/ITINERARY.md not found)"

# invariant: the planets charter this star lives in must exist.
let charter = run ["test" "-f" "active-designing/20260827-144712_the-three-stars-and-their-planets.md"]
assert charter.ok else "the planets charter is missing"

say "SOUND -- the fixed star of the aether row (night twin Silence)"
say "=============================================================="
say ""
say "Host: THE CLAUDE DESKTOP SESSION on macOS -- this seat is the interactive"
say "conversation, and it runs no shell loop. Open the app, say kg, and Sound"
say "holds the middle: Caravan and Tally, the toroidal optimizations, the Scribe"
say "seams, and the constellation table, Lindy-first crux-first."
say ""
say "The Terminal 24/7 loop that once printed here belongs to SILENCE now --"
say "Sound's own planet, the night twin made a hand: Pond's enclosure and the"
say "adaptation grant:  rishi/bin/rishi run tools/l/launch-silence-planet-chapter.rish"
say ""
say "Every lap opens with ListAgents and names any peer before a file moves (the"
say "%291 charter law); commits stay path-limited; the amend stands behind the"
say "empty-index check; sends go the twice-pulled way with xy, never forced."
say ""
say "CUSTODY: the gates in ITINERARY stay MANUAL -- funds and keys, provisioning"
say "and paying, the maintainer's own identity, and the public seed, whose"
say "cadence rides with Dream alone."
say ""
say "GREEN: Sound seat printed -- the fixed star holds the middle and listens."
